{"agent":"main","body":{"error":null,"exit":0,"for_seq":11,"result_bytes":495,"result_hash":"sha256:228cdf56f4d0112aa3e4cbe41bf6bb4fe24c3aa71da31c72a2982fb828f542a2","result_inline":"invoice.test.ts\nreceipt.test.ts\n.\n..\n.gitignore\nconfig.toml\ncontract.md\nevidence\nmanifest.json\nobserved\nred\nrequest.md\nsnap\ntrace\nInvoices and receipts disagree on negative amounts: the invoice prints -$1.50 and the receipt prints $-2.50 for the same refund. Both files carry their own copy of formatMoney. Pull one formatMoney out into src/money.ts with the invoice's behaviour and use it from both invoice.ts and receipt.ts. Leave src/legacy alone, its output is frozen for the finance export.","served":"live","truncated":false,"wall_ms":0},"hash":"sha256:cecc165e545ab307fb94cf97f4345452fae7b0820c991086f0928114746745b1","mono_ns":12000000,"prev":"sha256:dbcaf642023b952f5f4340d0f233c6cc87af08220a1ed1fc8732c5c0d1d372ca","schema":"saga.trace/1","seq":12,"session":"1e328cba-f780-4a85-806c-cedfcd6be074","source":"stream-json","ts":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.012Z","turn":1,"type":"tool_result"}
